From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MixOS project <mixos@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] remoteproc: qcom_q6v5_mss: add MSM8917 modem support

The MSM8917 (Snapdragon 425) modem subsystem is the same Hexagon-generation
MSS as MSM8916: same MBA/MPS download handshake, same set of shutdown-ack
interrupts, same regulators-behind-RPM. Reuse the msm8916_mss data under
the 8917 compatible so the LG K20 Plus modem can boot on mainline.

CHECK on hardware: confirm MBA auth passes and the modem reaches running
state before enabling the node (it ships disabled until the CX/MX power
domains are proven up).
---
 drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c b/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c
+++ b/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c
@@ -2532,6 +2532,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id q6v5_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,q6v5-pil", .data = &msm8916_mss},
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8909-mss-pil", .data = &msm8909_mss},
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8916-mss-pil", .data = &msm8916_mss},
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8917-mss-pil", .data = &msm8916_mss},
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8953-mss-pil", .data = &msm8953_mss},
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8974-mss-pil", .data = &msm8974_mss},
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8996-mss-pil", .data = &msm8996_mss},
